# The docs are client-side routes, so /docs/agent is not a file on disk. A
# static host has to fall back to index.html or every deep link 404s: the
# landing page would work and every link off it would not.
#
# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages both read this file, and both serve a real
# file in preference to a rewrite, so /install.sh is still install.sh.
# On another host, configure the same fallback there.
/*    /index.html   200
